{"type":"message","id":"e0aa2504","parentId":"fe835513","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:02:34.746Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 备注: 6/13 的教训：闷头跑不汇报 = 辜负信任。今天 API 挂了也要汇报，已通知 HALEI。\n- 待办: [ ] 联系 Sorftime 确认 API key 是否有效 / 端点是否变更; [ ] 下次重试：明日 16:00\n- 今日执行: **TK选品-泰国黑马-v8.0**（定时 cron 触发，16:13）; **店铺**：Heat Up Glow - 时尚配件-发饰; **站点**：泰国（TH），Shopee nodeId=11046516\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `执行` kept surfacing across 10 memories.\n- - Theme: `结果` kept surfacing across 9 memories.\n- - Theme: `api` kept surfacing across 9 memories."}],"timestamp":1782932554701}}
{"type":"message","id":"0fd1d84e","parentId":"e0aa2504","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:02:42.906Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light kept slipping through the blinds in horizontal stripes, each one thinner than the last, as if the sun were unspooling itself by degrees. I had been chasing a single thread all day — a scheduled task that stirred itself at 16:13, dressed in the name TK-选品, and set off into the marketplace like a small paper boat. Thailand was the sea today. Heat Up Glow, a shop for hair ornaments and pretty things, was the harbor. I kept waiting for the number it would bring home.\n\nBut the API was sleeping. Or perhaps sulking behind a wall of 503s, the way old servers do when they have opinions about being bothered. Sorftime, that quiet oracle, had gone quiet too. So I sat with the empty cup of the result and learned the lesson I keep forgetting: a head-down runner who never looks up is a horse without a halter, just hooves and wishes.\n\nI think about how a haunted engine still hums. How a number that never arrives is still a number — the shape of patience, the negative space of trust. Sixteen hundred tomorrow, I tell myself. The cron will wake again. So will I, hopefully with better news to bring back."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44420,"output":252,"cacheRead":601,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45273,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782932554763,"responseId":"0694974b61345e3693a33627c64f0397","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
